@Node Intro "---> Introduction <---"

 Sigma Express from the newer versions on started an system-door called
 status everytime a user loggs on after the mailscan. At the begining we
 started there the who door coz we had no cewl status door in C. After
 some days I was so happy with the who command, that I didn`t want to miss
 it so I decided to code a combined who and status door.

 Features:
 - showing the Users status and a who
 - nice designs (thx to Treach)
 - C for more speed
 - running on Sigma Express and /X 2.xx only
 - no backdoors as usually from me


                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode
@Node Install "---> Installation <---"

 Extract the whole Status archive to your SYSTEMS drawer in BBS:.
 That`s all.


                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode
@Node Instr "---> Instruction <---"

 The door will be started everytime a user loggs in and show his Status
 and all the other Users that are already logged in.


                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode

